<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.priceaction.ingest15m</string>

  <!--
    DEPLOY 2026-05-29: 15m live ingest, her 5 dakika.
    scripts/ingest_15m_live.py — 14 sembol, son 10 bar incremental upsert.

    DEPO-AYIRMA: market_ingest.duckdb'ye yazar (force_write=True), market.duckdb'ye
    DEĞİL. market.duckdb tazeliğini scheduler `market_snapshot` job (:05) atomik
    file-replace ile sağlar. Bu job market.duckdb'ye DOKUNMAZ → lock contention yok.

    Windows->Mac göçünde (05-22) bu besleme cron'u taşınmadı → 15m veri 6 gün bayat
    kaldı → 48 regime_cache_stale + 12 correlation_gate_hard_block reddi. Bu job onu onarir.

    Neden launchd (cron değil): macOS'te kullanici cron'u güvenilmez (login session,
    PATH, env). launchd doğru yol — StartInterval + RunAtLoad deterministik.

    Load:    launchctl bootstrap gui/501 ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.priceaction.ingest15m.plist
    Unload:  launchctl bootout gui/501 ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.priceaction.ingest15m.plist
    Manual:  launchctl kickstart gui/501/com.priceaction.ingest15m
    Test:    .venv/bin/python scripts/ingest_15m_live.py
  -->

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/Users/peyman/price-action-bot/.venv/bin/python</string>
    <string>-u</string>
    <string>scripts/ingest_15m_live.py</string>
  </array>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/peyman/price-action-bot</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PYTHONPATH</key>
    <string>/Users/peyman/price-action-bot/src</string>
    <key>TZ</key>
    <string>UTC</string>
    <key>PYTHONUNBUFFERED</key>
    <string>1</string>
    <!-- NOT: PA_DUCKDB_READ_ONLY set EDILMEZ. ingest_15m_live.py market_ingest.duckdb'ye
         force_write=True ile yazar (env bypass). market.duckdb'ye direkt yazmaz. -->
  </dict>

  <!-- Her 5 dakika (300 s). Scheduler hourly ingest (:00) ile çakışsa bile aynı
       hedef dosya idempotent upsert — veri kaybı yok; DuckDB single-writer reddi
       olursa job exit 1 ile fail-loud, sonraki tick'te tazeler. -->
  <key>StartInterval</key>
  <integer>300</integer>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/peyman/price-action-bot/logs/launchd/ingest15m.stdout.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/peyman/price-action-bot/logs/launchd/ingest15m.stderr.log</string>

  <key>SoftResourceLimits</key>
  <dict>
    <key>NumberOfFiles</key>
    <integer>4096</integer>
  </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
